#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find cut locations, given a maximum of 4 qubits per subcircuit. This circuit can be separated in two by making a single wire cut and cutting one `CRZGate` {#find-cut-locations-given-a-maximum-of-4-qubits-per-subcircuit-this-circuit-can-be-separated-in-two-by-making-a-single-wire-cut-and-cutting-one-crzgate}"
msgstr "إيجاد مواضع القطع مع تحديد حد أقصى يبلغ 4 qubits لكل دائرة فرعية. يمكن فصل هذه الدائرة إلى قسمين بإجراء قطع سلك واحد وقطع `CRZGate` واحد {#find-cut-locations-given-a-maximum-of-4-qubits-per-subcircuit-this-circuit-can-be-separated-in-two-by-making-a-single-wire-cut-and-cutting-one-crzgate}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/04-automatic-cut-finding/output_2.png)\n"
